      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func main() {  &#xA;    a := 5&#xA;    b := 8.1&#xA;    fmt.Println(a &amp;#43; b)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;A.13.1&#xA;B.13&#xA;C.compilation error&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;Reference Answer and Analysis: C. The type of &lt;code&gt;a&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;int&lt;/code&gt;, and the type of &lt;code&gt;b&lt;/code&gt; is &lt;code&gt;float&lt;/code&gt;. Two numerical values of different types cannot be added, resulting in a compilation error.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
